1056
01:31:58,096 --> 01:32:08,016
Least privilege is a security principle granting users, agents, and systems only the minimum permissions required to perform their intended task.

1057
01:32:08,206 --> 01:32:16,324
So what this means is, is if I'm wanting to build an agent that is a, you know, a phishing policy agent to help people understand what to do if you click on a suspicious email link.

