02:22:00,768 --> 02:22:05,008
All right, this gives us the ability to do to see those sort of things.

1683
02:22:05,377 --> 02:22:08,768
A tenant level insights into Co-pilot, Agent 365 agents.

1684
02:22:08,910 --> 02:22:14,768
We have the ability to register third party agents, security and licensing as a big piece here, Purview, Defender.

1685
02:22:14,990 --> 02:22:27,300
If you're not sure what Purview and Defender were, I had questions that it didn't ask me what Defender was or what Purview was, but it talked about, "Hey, we use Defender for this Or purview for this, and it was very critical to the correct answer.

