1697
02:23:43,790 --> 02:23:58,848
And so the idea is okay how do we actually keep track of the things that we want to now prioritize that are aligned with our business goals and our AI strategy and our team's current skills the idea is all of those items can fall into a backlog basically a task list of things that need to be completed.

